sdiv7: x / 7, for x from -999 to 999, truncated toward zero. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-20, with x in cell 90.
Copy cells 10-20 to where the program needs x / 7, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x; the program goes on with x / 7 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator; x is kept.
Size 11 cells. It runs 11 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-20: 143x / 1000 by Horner's rule (digits 3, 4, 1)
 11     290      ADD 90
 12     290      ADD 90
 13     401      SFT 01
 14     290      ADD 90
 15     290      ADD 90
 16     290      ADD 90
 17     290      ADD 90
 18     401      SFT 01
 19     290      ADD 90
 20     401      SFT 01
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
